&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services Senior Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;UK (Remote)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services (PS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services is looking for a high-energy, strategic, and results-driven Senior Project Manager to lead complex, enterprise customer implementations and help shape the future of our delivery practice. In this role, you will be customer-facing, acting as a trusted advisor to ensure deployment success, business value realisation, and operational efficiency. You will own high-stakes client engagements end-to-end, bringing deep project management expertise to solve problems on the ground and drive customer outcomes with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Project Manager in our PS Organisation, you will drive impact primarily through hands-on delivery excellence, leadership, and practice enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Client Delivery Excellence&lt;br&gt;● Drive Complex Engagements: Lead end-to-end delivery of complex, concurrent, enterprise-level&amp;nbsp;customer projects from kickoff to sign-off within fast-paced environments.&lt;br&gt;● Scope &amp;amp; Milestone Management: Prepare enterprise customers for deployment, establish clear&amp;nbsp;success criteria, track deliverables, set targets, manage resources, and ensure project execution&amp;nbsp;adheres to deadlines and budgets.&lt;br&gt;● Risk &amp;amp; Issue Governance: Proactively identify, track, and mitigate project risks and technical&amp;nbsp;dependencies, resolving issues autonomously before they escalate.&lt;br&gt;● Stakeholder Alignment: Serve as the single point of contact and escalation owner for customer&amp;nbsp;executives, cross-functional internal teams (Engineering, Customer Support, Sales), and third-&amp;nbsp;party partners.&lt;br&gt;● Quality &amp;amp; Performance: Execute quality control throughout project lifecycles to ensure deliverables meet or exceed Rubrik&#39;s standards and customer business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. PMO &amp;amp; Process Optimisation&lt;br&gt;● Partner with PS leadership to help build, refine, and maintain the PMO governance framework, including standard operating procedures, project methodologies, and key performance indicators.&lt;br&gt;● Continuous Improvement: Flag bottlenecks and recommend improvements that enhance&amp;nbsp;operational efficiency, margins, and customer satisfaction.&lt;br&gt;● Assist in establishing best practices for your engagements, resource allocation, utilisation tracking, and project health reporting across the PS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 8+ years of direct Project Management experience delivering customer-facing, enterprise&amp;nbsp;technical projects within a Professional Services or Consulting organization.&lt;br&gt;● Previous experience with managing customers from Financial Services, Government, Healthcare&amp;nbsp;industries&lt;br&gt;● Track record of managing multiple complex, high-visibility client engagements concurrently in a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced technology environment.&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrated ability to work autonomously, exercising strong judgment and decision-making in&amp;nbsp;ambiguous, high-pressure customer situations.&lt;br&gt;● Expert knowledge of modern project management tools (e.g., Smartsheet, Jira, Confluence,&amp;nbsp;Asana) as well as Google Workspace.&lt;br&gt;● Fluent written and spoken English skill is a must.&lt;br&gt;● Exceptional executive communication, stakeholder management, negotiation, and conflict&amp;nbsp;resolution skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Recognised credentials like Project Management Professional (PMP), PRINCE2, knowledge of Agile/Scrum (CSM, PMI-ACP), or Lean frameworks.&lt;br&gt;● Technical Background: Prior hands-on experience or foundational knowledge in Data&amp;nbsp;Management, Cloud Infrastructure (AWS, Azure, GCP), Data Protection, Enterprise Storage,&amp;nbsp;Cybersecurity, or SaaS delivery is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;● Financial acumen regarding professional services metrics (e.g., revenue recognition, margin,&amp;nbsp;utilization, project profitability).&lt;br&gt;● Additional European language skills (German, Spanish etc.) are a great plus.&lt;br&gt;● Experience contributing to PMO governance practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services transforms possibilities into outcomes. Our portfolio of services uncovers&amp;nbsp;and exploits the unique opportunities made possible by Rubrik technology. Drawing on our unparalleled&amp;nbsp;product expertise and customer experiences, we collaborate with customers to identify and address&amp;nbsp;complex technical challenges, improve operational efficiency, and maximize their investment in Rubrik.&amp;nbsp;We are 100% focused on customer success, operational excellence, and empowering our team members&amp;nbsp;to grow, lead, and innovate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Why At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Dotmatics, a Siemens company,&amp;nbsp; we believe science, data, and decision-making must be deeply intertwined for innovation to thrive. Our Portfolio includes Luma, LumaLab Connect, ELN Platform, Graphpad Prism, Geneious, SnapGene, Protein Metrics, OMIQ, FCS Express, LabArchives, NQuery, EasyPanel, SoftGenetics and Virscidian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a vision for a new Lab of the Future that will change the future of scientific research.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have created the world’s most comprehensive digital science platform – best-of-breed software applications already used by more than 2 million scientists, together in a single ecosystem united by a powerful, flexible enterprise data platform. This is not flat data buried away in digital graveyards. This is dynamic, multi-dimensional decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scientific enterprises need a new level of effectiveness to achieve tomorrow’s breakthroughs. Illness will not wait. The biosphere will not wait. We are tireless in our vision, because the time for innovation is now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping the Future of Science At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global team of more than 800 colleagues are dedicated to supporting our customers in over 180 countries. Together, with our scientific community of users, we accelerate scientific innovation in order to make the world a healthier, cleaner, and safer place to live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a collaborative, global team pushing the boundaries of scientific innovation.&amp;nbsp; Your ideas and efforts will have a tangible impact, accelerating scientific progress and discovery. We offer a dynamic, remote-friendly environment that fosters high integrity and collaboration, empowering you to excel. Dotmatics is a company built by scientists, for scientists. Combined, we are now the world’s largest cloud-based scientific research R&amp;amp;D platform. We need your help to keep growing and pioneering the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Science Driven. We are Customer Centric. We are Better Together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced market leader, thought leader and SME in Lab Automation and Orchestration.&lt;br&gt;Lab automation is where science meets engineering. Robotics, liquid handlers, instruments, and scheduling software are moving labs from manual work toward automated, data driven, and eventually autonomous operation. While we are supporting fully automated labs, most labs still run as islands. Instruments speak different languages, workflows are hard to change, and the data that comes off the line rarely arrives ready for analysis or AI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building Luma, a Scientific Intelligence Platform for life sciences and materials science. Lab Orchestration and automation are core to our Molecule to Market story, and they connect directly to the strengths of Siemens in industrial automation. We need someone to own the market strategy for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a customer and market facing role. You’ll spend real time with lab automation leaders at pharma, biotech, CDMOs, and research institutes across the UK and Europe, hearing what they need and bringing it back to the business. You’ll also support teams around the world across Siemens, including sales, product, services, customer success, and the Siemens Solution Marketing team, so everyone can speak to the lab automation market with confidence and one consistent story. You’ll work with industry thought leaders to shape the conversation on autonomous labs and AI. Your job is to drive software adoption and AI use cases in lab automation. You will shape where we play, who we sell to, how we position, and how we win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll spend your time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer engagements: meeting automation leaders, scientists, and engineers, joining pursuits, and bringing what you hear back to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market analysis: sizing segments, tracking competitors and automation vendors, and spotting trends early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales enablement: giving teams across regions the talk tracks, battlecards, demo narratives, and proof points to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution marketing: partnering with the Siemens Solution Marketing team on content, campaigns, events, and messaging for the lab automation audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought leadership: working with industry thought leaders, inside and outside Siemens, to shape the conversation on self driving labs and the future of the automated lab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption and AI use cases: identifying, proving, and spreading the use cases that get labs running on Luma and putting AI to work on automated workflows and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and ecosystem engagement: working with instrument makers, robotics providers, and integrators so our joint story is clear to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross organization alignment: working across Siemens DISW and DI Automation teams so we show up as one company with one story for the lab automation market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is simple. Drive excellence in how we represent ourselves to lab automation buyers, and turn that into real software adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the market strategy for Luma in lab automation, including workflow orchestration, scheduling, instrument integration, data capture, and autonomous lab concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define target segments, buyer personas, and priority accounts, including Heads of Lab Automation, Automation Engineers, Discovery Technologies, Research IT, Core Facilities, and Operations leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build positioning and messaging that speaks to automation engineers, scientists, IT leaders, and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive software adoption by working with customers and field teams to find the workflows where Luma delivers value fastest, and by capturing what works so others can repeat it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and prove AI use cases for lab automation, including closed loop experimentation, smarter scheduling, and data prepared for tools like NVIDIA BioNeMo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate automation pain points into clear value, including less integration work, faster workflow changes, better use of instruments, trusted data, and a clear path from automation islands to connected labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Siemens Solution Marketing team to build content, campaigns, and events for the lab automation market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with industry thought leaders, analysts, and partners to build credibility and bring outside voices into our story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the competitive view against other informatics vendors, scheduling and orchestration tools, automation vendors, and in house builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the business case, pricing inputs, and value story with Finance and Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip global teams with talk tracks, battlecards, demo narratives, and customer proof points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with DISW and DI Automation teams to align messaging, joint offers, and customer conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product on roadmap priorities based on what automation teams tell us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect lab automation to the bigger Molecule to Market narrative, including ELN, Biologics, and Tech Transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic pursuits and executive conversations with customers and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track market trends, including autonomous labs, AI driven discovery, robotics, and data standards, and turn them into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for people who have &lt;/strong&gt;10 or more years in life sciences, lab automation, or scientific technology, with hands on experience in a pharma, biotech, CDMO, research institute, or automation vendor setting.&amp;nbsp; You will bring Strong analytical skills, including sizing markets and building a business case excellent writing and presentation skills. Ideally holding a degree in life sciences, engineering, robotics, or a related field, with a Masters or PhD a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The key skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how automated labs work day to day, including liquid handling, robotics, instrument integration, workflow scheduling, and the data that flows from them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of how automation leaders make decisions, balance speed, cost, and flexibility, and work with scientists, IT, and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in product marketing, market strategy, product management, or commercial roles at a software, automation, informatics, or life sciences solutions company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scheduling and orchestration software, LIMS, ELN, or lab data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving software adoption, or of turning new technology such as AI into use cases customers actually adopt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to turn complex science and technology into clear, simple messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with senior leaders, industry experts, and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across a large, global, matrixed organisation and build trust with teams in different regions and business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running or supporting a lab automation team or an automated lab build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of industrial automation concepts and how they apply to the lab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with lab data standards and open interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI, machine learning, or data platforms in a scientific setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with industry thought leaders, analysts, automation vendors, or research institutes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across the UK and European life sciences community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear lab automation market strategy adopted by Sales, Product, Services, and Solution Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Messaging and sales tools that teams around the world actually use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One consistent story for lab automation across Dotmatics, DISW, and DI Automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing software adoption and a library of proven AI use cases in lab automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry voices who help tell our story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing pipeline and wins tied to lab automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation leaders who can say, in their own words, why Luma helps them connect their labs and move toward autonomous operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Research shows us the&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;confidence gap&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;imposter syndrome can get in the way of meeting outstanding candidates, so please don’t hesitate to apply — we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that Dotmatics may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organization planning, and related purposes. Dotmatics &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dotmatics.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://legal.hubspot.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; explains what personal information we may process, where we may process your personal information, our purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over Dotmatics use of your personal information.&lt;span class=&quot;c-message__edited_label&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dotmatics is an equal opportunity employer. We are a welcoming place for everyone, and we do our best to make sure all people feel supported and connected at work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addepar is a global data and AI platform empowering investment professionals to turn complex financial information into actionable intelligence. Addepar unifies portfolio, market and client data in a total portfolio view and delivers AI-powered insights within investment and client workflows. More than 1,500 firms in 60 countries use Addepar to manage and advise on nearly $10 trillion in assets. Its open platform integrates with 650 software, data and consulting partners to power end-to-end investment operations across firms of all sizes and levels of complexity. Addepar supports clients worldwide with offices in New York City, Salt Lake City, São Paulo, London, Edinburgh, Geneva, Warsaw, Dubai, Pune and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Applied AI team works embedded with Addepar&#39;s strategic clients to figure out where AI can change how they work and then build those capabilities from scratch. You&#39;ll spend time understanding a client&#39;s world, identify what&#39;s worth building, prototype it, prove it works, and then partner with core engineering teams to ship it as product for all customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Engineer, you&#39;ll build agentic systems from idea through production. The work starts with understanding the problem well enough to know what to build, then moves fast through prototyping and iteration. You&#39;ll design agent behavior, wire up tool integrations, tune evaluations until the AI actually works in practice. You&#39;ll sit close to the people who use what you build, and that feedback loop is how both the product and your skills grow fast. The team is new. Your work shapes what we ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role may require occasional work outside standard business hours to accommodate client time zones and up to 15% travel to client sites, including occasional overnight and multi-day engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered agents and tools end-to-end: identify the problem with clients and domain experts, prototype quickly, evaluate rigorously, and ship to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement LLM integrations including prompt engineering, function calling, structured outputs, and retrieval-augmented workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define evaluation criteria and build test harnesses for AI systems where correctness is ambiguous and domain-specific&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with clients to understand their workflows, validate AI behavior, and iterate toward production quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with core engineering teams to generalize client-specific work into product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shared AI infrastructure (agent frameworks, tool integrations, deployment pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain production AI systems with attention to reliability, cost, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
