&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Creative Director to lead the Soho Home Creative team and shape the visual expression of the brand across photography, campaigns, content, art direction, digital, editorial and wider brand communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Chief Creative Officer, this role will translate the creative vision for Soho Home into a distinctive and cohesive visual world, ensuring every touchpoint feels considered, relevant and unmistakably Soho Home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Creative Director will lead the creative team and oversee the full creative process from concept and creative direction through to execution, ensuring a consistently high standard across all imagery and brand communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly collaborative role, working closely with the Head of Creative, Marketing, Photography, Content and wider Soho House teams to create compelling visual messaging that builds the Soho Home brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Creative Direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Chief Creative Officer to define and evolve the overall creative direction and visual identity of Soho Home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the wider brand vision into a clear and distinctive visual language across all creative output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the creative standard for Motion, photography, art direction, campaigns, editorial, digital and content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all creative output feels cohesive whilst allowing for freshness, experimentation and evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative concepts and visual narratives that bring Soho Home products, collections and collaborations to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain a strong visual point of view across all brand touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new creative opportunities, references, talent, collaborators and cultural influences that can strengthen the Soho Home brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the creative team to produce work that is distinctive, culturally relevant and visually compelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Creative Team Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire and develop the Soho Home Creative team, creating a high-performing and collaborative creative culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and support the Head of Creative, ensuring clear direction, priorities and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the wider creative function, including Photography, Art Direction, Content and other creative disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations around creative quality, output, ownership and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the team&#39;s capabilities, identifying opportunities for growth and new creative talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the right creative resource is in place for each project, balancing internal capability with freelance and external talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear creative feedback and direction throughout the development and execution of projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment where the team is encouraged to challenge, experiment and bring new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Photography &amp;amp; Art Direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the creative direction and standards across all Soho Home creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Photographer and Art Direction team to develop a distinctive photographic language for the brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead creative direction for product, lifestyle, interiors, campaign and editorial photography &amp;amp; motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear principles for lighting, composition, styling, set design, casting, locations and visual storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and commission photographers, stylists, set designers, artists and other creative talent where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve photography concepts, treatments, moodboards, shoot plans and final imagery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure photography consistently reflects the quality, character and creative ambition of Soho Home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong and evolving network of creative talent and collaborators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Campaigns &amp;amp; Brand Communications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the creative development of Soho Home campaigns from initial concept through to final execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong creative concepts that connect product, brand, culture and storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Marketing to translate commercial priorities into compelling creative campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure campaigns have a clear visual narrative and consistent execution across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the creative direction of seasonal launches, key product moments, collaborations and brand initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Editorial, Digital, Social and Marketing teams to ensure creative is adapted appropriately across different channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Soho Home brand is presented consistently across every customer-facing touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Creative Process &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a clear creative process from briefing and concept development through to execution and final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure every project has a clear creative brief, visual direction and agreed output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility across the creative pipeline, ensuring priorities and deadlines are clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product Operations and relevant project leads to understand key product and business milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify creative risks or challenges early and develop solutions proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure creative projects are delivered on time and to the required standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually evolve the team&#39;s processes and ways of working to improve the quality and efficiency of creative output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Brand &amp;amp; Creative Standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the visual standards for Soho Home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency across photography, campaigns, digital, editorial and other customer-facing creative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear creative principles and guidance for internal teams and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect the integrity of the Soho Home brand whilst allowing the creative expression to evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all external creative partners understand and deliver against the Soho Home creative vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually benchmark the brand against leading creative, fashion, interiors, hospitality and cultural brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, Product, NPD and Commercial teams to understand business priorities and translate them into strong creative output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with external agencies, photographers, stylists, artists, production companies and other creative partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present creative concepts and recommendations confidently to senior leadership and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience as a Creative Director or senior creative leader within luxury, interiors, fashion, hospitality, lifestyle or a related creative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly developed and distinctive creative point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading multidisciplinary creative teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience across photography, art direction, campaigns and visual storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional eye for composition, styling, detail and visual narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how to build and evolve a distinctive brand world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience commissioning and directing photographers, stylists, artists and other creative talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing creative campaigns from initial concept through to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of luxury, interiors, fashion, hospitality, culture and contemporary visual communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation and communication skills, with the ability to articulate creative ideas clearly and inspire others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership skills, with the ability to give clear direction whilst empowering creative talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, commercially aware and comfortable working with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational skills and the ability to manage multiple creative projects and competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong network of creative talent and a genuine curiosity for emerging photographers, artists, designers, cultural movements and new visual languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance creative ambition with commercial requirements, deadlines and practical delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soho House offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;
